# Privacy Policy — Last Innocent

**Last Updated:** August 22, 2026

Last Innocent is developed and published by **Ahmed Albayati**.

The game may use third-party services such as Google Play Services, Google AdMob, and analytics/crash-reporting services. These services may automatically collect information such as device information, advertising identifiers, game activity, crash data, and general usage data.

Last Innocent does not directly request or collect sensitive personal information such as your name, address, or contacts.

Advertisements may be displayed in the game. Third-party advertising providers may use device identifiers and related information to provide and measure advertisements.

Collected information is used to operate the game, improve performance, fix problems, understand game usage, and provide advertising features.

Third-party services have their own privacy policies and data practices.

This policy may be updated when the game or its services change.

